[[0,1396611,0,78,1,77,"2016-11-08T00:56:45","DietCokehead1","",[],"","PSA: Pennsylvania voters get a free Uber or Lyft ride to the polls using code \"VOTEPA\". Hillary is funding it. (Redpill your driver en route)","","whatever"],[1,6755670,0,1,0,1,"2016-11-08T01:21:53","MaxDragon","",[],"<p>So Trump continues rallying and Hillary continues trying to buy votes.</p>"],[1,6755736,0,1,0,1,"2016-11-08T01:32:28","tippyc","",[],"<p>is that even legal?</p>"],[2,6755748,6755736,1,0,1,"2016-11-08T01:34:06","DietCokehead1","",[],"<p>apparently</p>"],[2,6755758,6755736,5,0,5,"2016-11-08T01:36:06","Spaceballs-1","",[],"<p>Sure why not? It isn't commensurate on you actually VOTING for Hillary, just on voting. </p>"],[1,6755771,0,5,0,5,"2016-11-08T01:38:18","NotWearingPants","",[],"<p>If you have the time, relocate a good distance away from your polling place before calling for the ride.</p>"],[2,6755781,6755771,6,0,6,"2016-11-08T01:38:54","DietCokehead1","",[],"<p>To run-up the bill?</p>"],[3,6755798,6755781,10,0,10,"2016-11-08T01:42:17","NotWearingPants","",[],"<p>Yep. The clinton criminal enterprise may as well boost the economy.</p>"],[4,6755980,6755798,2,0,2,"2016-11-08T02:13:50","bikergang_accountant","[e]",[],"<p>PA is a tough state to drive through from end to end. Good.</p>"],[1,6755796,0,7,0,7,"2016-11-08T01:41:43","watch_listed","",[],"<p>It's a great way to target her preferred demographic. I'm willing to bet that most folks who use those services with any regularity weren't planning on voting for Trump, anyway.</p>"],[2,6756956,6755796,1,3,-2,"2016-11-08T04:36:58","Womb_Raider","",[],"<p>Anyone who uses Uber over a Taxi service is economically ignorant.</p>"],[1,6755857,0,6,0,6,"2016-11-08T01:53:13","Dereliction","",[],"<p>She knows it is all about turnout for her. Her apathetic voters are even more apathetic if they have to get themselves to the poll station.</p>"],[1,6755874,0,3,0,3,"2016-11-08T01:56:29","sheetrock","",[],"<p>Is this a round trip? Hoping not, because then it's almost performance art.</p>\n<p>&quot;Okay, I just finished voting for you... hey, where'd my ride go?&quot;</p>"],[1,6756232,0,30,0,30,"2016-11-08T02:49:57","rocketrouser","",[],"<p>But you have to pay to get back home. She's literally abandoning you the moment after you cast your vote, a good lesson for many.</p>"],[2,6756516,6756232,10,0,10,"2016-11-08T03:27:51","PurpleLace","",[],"<p>This is actually a great comparison.</p>"]]
