[[0,1396618,0,1,0,1,"2016-11-08T01:03:34","Swolebroshitlord1","",[],"","Did I come across wonky eye on Tinder?","https://sli.mg/LVAdHd","fatpeoplehate"],[1,6755728,0,10,0,10,"2016-11-08T01:31:15","LessBingeMorePurge","",[],"<p>No, that's not her, that's someone trying to emulate her, which is honestly even worse. </p>"],[1,6755937,0,4,0,4,"2016-11-08T02:06:04","HackTheGibbon","",[],"<p>What the hell is wonky eye?</p>"],[2,6756294,6755937,4,0,4,"2016-11-08T02:57:39","Youfatfuck","",[],"<p>Welcome to FPH! The wonk is an oft-featured cow here. It's superfat but pretends it isn't (camera angle). It has a fucked-up eye but pretends it doesn't (hair covering half its face). Lots of spackle makeup. Nasty.</p>"],[1,6756263,0,3,0,3,"2016-11-08T02:52:58","pedestrian_x","",[],"<p>Don't think so, just some other cow trying to be artsy or something.</p>"],[1,6757034,0,7,0,7,"2016-11-08T04:49:25","Carsandsarcasm","",[],"<p>Haha. This highlights fairly well how alike they all are. You just become Another Fat once you get over a certain weight. </p>"],[2,6757894,6757034,5,0,5,"2016-11-08T09:12:37","bock","",[],"<p>THIS. Once you pack on enough fat bones, features, structures..everything literally melts away into a pool of blubber.</p>"],[1,6758068,0,0,1,-1,"2016-11-08T10:27:15","Mass_Eject","",[],"<p>I seriously doubt you'd have the fortitude to come across that.</p>"],[1,6760589,0,1,0,1,"2016-11-08T17:55:03","Mustlovedogs","",[],"<p>My son was showing me some pictures on his phone...one had a girls with half her face covered with hair...I said oh does she have something wrong her eye? He said yeah how did you know? I just laughed and said let me teach you how to spot a fat and other things!!! </p>"],[1,6765029,0,0,0,0,"2016-11-09T03:23:48","theepilepticferret","",[],"<p>No, I'm pretty sure Wonk's real name is Jessica</p>"]]
